id=ath9k_htc_vermeer
name=ath9k_htc (AR9271) for vermeer
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Tears Burn
description=Loads ath9k_htc + deps at boot and provides htc_9271-1.4.0.fw so a TP-Link TL-WN722N v1 (AR9271) works over OTG. Requires a kernel built with CONFIG_ATH9K_HTC=m. Does not touch the vendor wireless stack.
